    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to present 32 Castleview Lawns to the market, an attractive three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence extending to approximately 89 m², ideally positioned within this established and convenient residential development in Swords.\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and, while it would benefit from some modernisation and refurbishment, it presents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to create a comfortable contemporary home tailored to their own taste.\r\nOne of the particular advantages of No. 32 is its end-of-terrace position, offering additional privacy and adding to the overall appeal and potential of the property.\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, living room and kitchen/dining area. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite bathroom, together with a family bathroom. The property benefits from a private mature rear garden with side entrance access, there is also ample parking to the front.\r\nCastleview Lawns enjoys an excellent location within easy reach of Swords Main Street and Swords Village, with a wide variety of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities nearby. Swords Pavilions Shopping Centre is also within easy reach, while the area is particularly well served by public transport.\r\nFor commuters, the property offers convenient access to Dublin Airport, the M1, M50 and Dublin City Centre, making it an appealing option for those seeking a well-connected home within a mature residential setting.\r\nWith its combination of three-bedroom accommodation, main bedroom en-suite, end-of-terrace position, and excellent potential to modernise, No. 32 represents a superb opportunity for first-time buyers, young families or those looking to create a home to their own specification.\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Dining Area - 3.49m x 3.57m\r\nKitchen - 2.80m x 2.52m\r\nLiving Room - 4.64m x 3.44m\r\nMain Bedroom - 4.65m x 3.56\r\nEn-suite - 1.88m x 1.62m\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.44m x 3.44m\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.09m x 3.48m\r\nMain Bathroom - 2.53m x 1.74m"
      },
      {
