        "Content": "Attractive 3-bedroom end-of-terrace residence \r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nGas Central Heating\r\nMain bedroom with en-suite \r\nExcellent potential to modernise and upgrade \r\nConvenient to Swords Village and Pavilions Shopping Centre \r\nExcellent schools and amenities nearby"
